      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F0075006E006400730020006E00650061007400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Maybe you don’t get what I mean—or maybe you\ndo? Well, either way, allow me to explain.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThe move Metronome causes a Pokémon to use a\ncompletely random move!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
